    <string name="papattes_lab">Lab</string>
    <string name="papattes_rules">One finger, anywhere on the screen. What it does depends on the legs:\n\n• Walk: hold to swing the back leg forward, let go to plant the foot. Hold too long and it ends in the splits.\n• Hop: hold to crouch, let go to leap. The longer you hold, the farther you go.\n• Glide: hold to push and build speed, let go to roll. A quick tap jumps.\n\nReach the flag. The blue flag halfway saves your spot. Golden seeds are worth extra seeds.\n\nThree stars per stage: finish, all three golden seeds, never fall.\n\nIn the lab, buy a mystery egg with seeds. It gets ready once you finish a stage you have never finished. To hatch it, rub it until it cracks, then pull the shell pieces off.\n\nBreed two critters to mix their parts. Tap a part in the book to show only the critters that have it. Some bodies have a power: they float, glide, hold firm in the wind or bounce back from a fall.</string>
